\n\
Wait — actually, should I cast Momo now or hold? Casting now: 1/1 flyer adds to air pressure (attacks for 1 in the air with vigilance, still blocks). Costs {W}, I have exactly 1 untapped Plains. Holding it: no benefit really. Cast it.\n\
