\n\
But to get to 4 counters I need two creatures to enter this turn. I only have one creature in hand (Captain). Ally Token already on board. So Ascension would be at 3 counters at end step — no trigger.\n\
\n\
Hmm, wait — could I blink a creature at 4 counters next turn? Next turn I'd play another creature hopefully. Actually, casting Captain this turn (3 counters), then next turn playing a creature (4 counters) → end step blink triggers. That's nice value.\n\
\n\
Actually, wait — should I think about the blinking the First-Time Flyer? If I blink the equipped First-Time Flyer, the Fan stays on the battlefield unattached. That might be fine.\n\
\n\
Now, combat math: opponent at 11. My air attack: 3 + 2 + 1 = 6 unblocked (opponent has no flyers). Opponent at 5.\n\
\n\
