\n\
Actually, wait — opponent just attacked with both creatures on their turn 5 (they're tapped). It's now my turn 6.\n\
\n\
Also consider: Barrels of Blasting Jelly — {5}, {T}, Sac: deals 5 damage to target creature. Opponent has 5 lands (Island, Island, Jasmine Dragon Tea Shop, Meditation Pools, North Pole Gates). They could activate it to kill one of my creatures. It's a mana ability to add one mana of any color once per turn too.\n\
