\n\
The equip costs {2}, and I have exactly 2 untapped lands. Equipping to whom? The Fan is already on First-Time Flyer (3/3). I could move it to Momo to make Momo 2/1, but First-Time Flyer would become 2/3. That doesn't change total damage.\n\
