\n\
Should I equip the Fan somewhere else? Currently on First-Time Flyer. Moving it to another creature doesn't increase total damage since all creatures get in unblocked regardless. Total power with Fan on Flyer: 3+2+1+1 = 7. Fan on anyone else: same total.\n\
\n\
Actually, is there any reason NOT to activate equip? Using my 2 mana for equip vs. saving it... I have no instants in hand (hand=0). My hand is empty. So the mana is useless otherwise. Actually, do I have anything else? Hand = 0 cards. So the 2 mana can only be used for equip or nothing.\n\
\n\
But wait — should I even bother equipping? The Fan is already on First-Time Flyer. Equipping again would just move it. There's no benefit unless I want to split up. Actually moving the Fan OFF First-Time Flyer would reduce it to 2/3. No reason to move it.\n\
