\n\
Actually, can I even activate the Iceberg? All my lands are tapped, so I can't pay {3}. The server lists it as playable... maybe it judges based on cheapest possible. But sacrificing the Iceberg releases Aang — bad. Pass.\n\
\n\
Next turn I'll be at 8 mana untap... wait, my turn 8: I untap, draw a card (empty hand). Ascension at 5 quest counters. Opponent at 6 life with Geyser Leaper 4/3 flying as a blocker. My flyers: First-Time Flyer 2/3 (3/3 with Lesson). Geyser Leaper can't block effectively... it can block 3/3 and trade? 4/3 vs 3/3: both die. Hmm.\n\
\n\
Anyway, pass now. Let me also send a chat message.",
