\n\
Is that trade good? Trading my 3/3 First-Time Flyer for their only flying blocker Geyser Leaper... Then next turn my Glider Kids (2/3) can attack freely in the air (no flying blockers left). They're at 6 life. Glider Kids attacks for 2 per turn. Hmm, that's 3 turns to kill. But they could also recast Aang if I sacrifice... no, Aang stays exiled as long as I don't sac the Iceberg.\n\
\n\
