      "thinking": "Board state: I'm at 16, they're at 6 with 0 cards in hand. My board: Aang's Iceberg (holding their Aang exiled), Airbender Ascension (6 quest counters), Ally token 1/1, Glider Kids 2/3 (summoning sick), Kyoshi Battle Fan (unequipped), 5 lands (3 tapped Islands, 2 tapped Plains — all tapped actually: 3 Islands tapped, 2 Plains tapped).\n\
\n\
