\n\
But regardless — sacrificing the Iceberg releases Aang. Not worth it. Pass.\n\
\n\
Postcombat main, nothing to do. Pass to end step. Ascension trigger at 6 quest counters will blink a creature — I can blink Glider Kids for a scry 1, and it untaps as a blocker.\n\
\n\
