\n\
Actually, one consideration: their First-Time Flyer is only a 1/2 (no Lesson in their gy — wait, actually is Octopus Form a Lesson? Let me check: \"Octopus Form: Target creature you control gets +1/+1...\" The card reference for my First-Time Flyer says \"Lesson cards in your graveyard: 1\" — Octopus Form must be a Lesson. Their graveyard: Barrels, Geyser Leaper, Glider Kids, Katara, Otter-Penguin — no Lessons, so their flyer is 1/2.)\n\
