      "thinking": "End step trigger from Ascension — blink up to one creature. Blinking First-Time Flyer would detach the Battle Fan (equipment stays on battlefield but unattached). Blinking Ally token loses it forever (tokens cease to exist in exile).\n\
\n\
Blinking First-Time Flyer: it would return, detach the Fan, but I'd gain a quest counter (Ascension to 10). No ETB effect on First-Time Flyer. Detaching the Fan is bad — I'd need to re-equip next turn with 2 mana. I have 5 lands + Waterskin = 6 mana, so I could re-equip. But the Flyer is currently tapped; blinking would untap it as a blocker? Actually it returns untapped. Hmm.\n\
\n\
Wait — my Flyer is tapped from attacking. If I blink it, it returns untapped, giving me a blocker. But the Fan detaches. Opponent at 3 life, my turn next: I re-equip (2 mana) and attack for lethal.\n\
\n\
Actually, is there value in blinking? The Flyer returning untapped as a blocker could matter if opponent attacks. Opponent's board: Water Tribe Rallier 2/2, Deserters 1/2, North Pole Patrol 2/3 (sick, will be unsick), Ally token 1/1. They could attack with Rallier/Deserters/Patrol. My life is 13, no real danger.\n\
\n\
If I blink the Flyer: Fan detaches, Flyer untaps as a 2/3 blocker (still has Lesson bonus? It's 3/3 due to Lesson in graveyard — the +1/+1 stays; Fan gives +1/+0 making it... wait, the Flyer shown as 3/3 includes Lesson bonus. Base 1/2 +1/+1 from Lesson = 2/3, +1/+0 from Fan = 3/3. If Fan detaches, it's 2/3.)\n\
\n\
Next turn: re-equip for 2, attack with 3/3. They have zero flying blockers. Lethal. That's fine.\n\
\n\
If I decline the blink: Flyer stays tapped but keeps Fan. Next turn it untaps anyway with Fan attached, attack for lethal.\n\
\n\
Either way works. Declining is simpler — keep Fan attached, lethal guaranteed next turn. Blinking gains a quest counter but no real benefit. Decline.\n\
\n\
Actually wait — one consideration: blink gives quest counter 10, and the Flyer returns and could block this turn if needed. But opponent's board is mostly tapped; Patrol will untap but I'm at 13. No danger. Decline to keep Fan attached.",
