- Ascension at 9 quest counters — end step blink. Blinking First-Time Flyer would detach the Fan but... actually blink also untaps it! If they tap my Flyer with Patrol, at my end step I could blink it with Ascension — it returns untapped? No wait, blink at end step returns it immediately but it would still be... no, when a permanent leaves and returns, it's a new object — it returns untapped. But it returns during my end step, so it'd be untapped for their turn, not for my attack. Hmm.\n\
\n\
Actually, the blink trigger is at the beginning of my end step. Sequence on my turn: they tap my Flyer in my precombat main (Patrol activation). I can't attack with it. At end step, Ascension blinks it, it returns untapped (Fan detached). Then on their turn they could tap it again with the second Patrol... they have two Patrols. Ugh.\n\
