Hmm, but actually on my turn it's their lands' state from their turn — they untap on their turn, use mana, then on my turn remaining untapped lands are available. They have 9 lands; if they spend 5 on Rallier dig on their turn, 4 remain for Patrol activation on my turn.\n\
