      "thinking": "The opponent has conceded verbally: \"That flyer gets through—missed my window to tap it before attacks. Good game!\"\n\
\n\
The situation: my First-Time Flyer (3/3 with Battle Fan) is attacking them, they're at 3 life with no flying blockers. Their only ability to activate is the Iceberg sacrifice, which would release Aang — bad. They have one untapped Island but 0 cards in hand. Their patrols are tapped, so they can't tap my attacker.\n\
\n\
