        "summary": "Opponent attacked with Katara (3/3 vigilance) on their turn 7. I'm double-blocking with both 2/3 flyers (First-Time Flyer p4 and Glider Kids p5): Katara's 3 damage kills one flyer, but my flyers deal 4 combined, killing Katara. Trading one 2/3 for their anthem threat is a great deal while I'm up 16-6.",
