        "summary": "Turn 8: I traded Glider Kids for Katara via double-block (16-6). Opponent has Geyser Leaper 4/3 (summoning sick) as their only flying blocker, zero cards in hand, all lands tapped. I'm casting Glider Kids from hand to rebuild my air force and push Ascension to 6 quest counters.",
