        "summary": "Turn 11: I drew Waterbending Lesson. Opponent at 3 life, 0 cards in hand, 1 untapped Plains, their 1/2 First-Time Flyer is the only flying blocker (summoning sick but can block). My First-Time Flyer is 3/3 with Battle Fan — lethal if unblocked. Casting Waterbending Lesson to dig for removal or a second flyer to win this turn.",
