        "choice": "p122",
        "summary": "Opponent's Rallier dig found nothing and they didn't attack — their board is tapped except two North Pole Patrols and 3 lands, they're at 3 life with 0 cards. My 3/3 First-Time Flyer is lethal in the air, but their untapped Patrol can Waterbend {3} to tap it each turn, so I need a second threat. Playing my Island land drop to maximize future mana.",
        "rationale": "Playing a land costs nothing and increases my mana for future turns while I dig for a second flyer or removal to break the Patrol stall.",
