7. Rocky Rebuke - green, off-color.\n\
8. Merchant of Many Hats - black, off-color.\n\
9. War Balloon - red, off-color.\n\
10. June, Bounty Hunter - black, we have one already but it's off our main colors.\n\
11. Sokka's Haiku {3}{U}{U} - counterspell + draw + mill + untap land. Strong but double blue at 5 mana. We are UW so UU is feasible. Counterspell with upside, and mill helps Lessons in graveyard (First-Time Flyer, Platypus-Bear).\n\
12. Buzzard-Wasp Colony - black, off-color.\n\
13. Airbender Ascension {1}{W} - rare, we already have one. It's a strong card in an allies/creature-heavy deck. Second copy is good.\n\
