Creatures: Katara, Avatar Enthusiasts, Cat-Owl, Water Tribe Captain, Platypus-Bear, Momo, Tiger-Seal, First-Time Flyer x2, Forecasting Fortune Teller, Glider Kids, Dai Li Agents (BG splash?), June (B splash), Zuko (BR splash). \n\
