\n\
Given the deck's creature-heavy nature with tokens, the Ascension's quest counter trigger will happen often. Two Ascensions is fine.\n\
\n\
Alternatively, Sokka's Haiku is a strong blue card. But double blue at 5 mana in a UW deck where white has a lot of presence... Katara is {2}{W}{U}{U} so the deck already supports UU costs. Tiger-Seal is {U}... fine.\n\
\n\
Hmm, which is better? Airbender Ascension is lower on the curve and synergizes with the go-wide theme. The deck has ~14 creatures plus token makers. The Ascension blink effect at end step can reuse ETBs (Katara token, Forecasting Fortune Teller clue, Glider Kids scry, Momo leaves-battlefield trigger).\n\
\n\
I think Airbender Ascension (13) is the pick. It's on-color, cheap, rare, and synergistic. Sokka's Haiku is good but the deck isn't desperate for a counterspell, and we want to keep the curve low for an aggressive UW flyers plan.\n\
\n\
Actually, let me reconsider - second copies of rares are fine but marginal value decreases. Sokka's Haiku adds a new dimension (interaction + card advantage + Lesson-mill synergy). Counterspell with draw a card is never bad. And the mill three helps First-Time Flyer/Platypus-Bear get Lessons in graveyard.\n\
\n\
But the deck already has 2x Waterbending Lesson and 2x Airbending Lesson for Lessons. Mill helps enable those too.\n\
\n\
Mana base: with ~17 lands, say 9 Islands 8 Plains. UU on turn 5 is reasonable.\n\
\n\
I still lean Airbender Ascension for curve and synergy. The deck is aggressive; a 2-mana tempo play (airbend a blocker) plus a growing threat is great. Also passing Sokka's Haiku signals blue but we're already set.\n\
\n\
One more consideration: Barrels of Blasting Jelly is colorless removal which the deck lacks (only Aang's Iceberg and airbending for removal). 5 damage for {5}{T} sac is clunky but the ramp half is fine. Not better than Ascension.\n\
\n\
Otter-Penguin is a fine 2-drop but we have decent 2-drops (First-Time Flyer x2, Forecasting Fortune Teller). The second-card-draw synergy is nice with Tiger-Seal and Waterbending Lesson. But not over Ascension.\n\
\n\
Pick: 13 (Airbender Ascension).\n\
